 "description": "APD membership vectors (protocol/apd.md). rule_valid: a rule as given (null or missing keys allowed) and the normalised rule every implementation must produce; rule_invalid: refused with the error given. membership_valid / membership_invalid likewise for {apd, number, expires} (missing keys are null). status: the verdict for a rule, a membership and the local date the check is for: missing, not_accepted, expired, valid, in that order of precedence. Written by hand from protocol/apd.md; the server, the Pi controller and the Dart controller and app all run these.",
